{"template":"ghost-wire","family":"wire","reference_source":"Ghost","reference_name":"Wire","reference_url":"https://ghost.org/themes/wire/","reference_categories":"news,magazine,newsroom","renderer_mix":"board,search,work,thread","density":"tight","hero_mode":"headline-stack","navigation_mode":"rail","media_mode":"thumbnail","typography_mode":"condensed-sans","card_mode":"ruled-row","chrome_mode":"minimal","territory_affinity":"live,work","semantic_roles":{"lede":"standfirst","meta":"dateline","accent":"section flag","muted":"byline"},"layout_tokens":{"ground":"#ffffff","ink":"#14161a","display":"#000000","accent":"#c8102e","muted":"#5f6873","rule":"rgba(0,0,0,.15)","panel":"#f5f6f8","face_display":"'Archivo','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif","face_body":"'Libre Franklin',system-ui,sans-serif","face_mono":"'DM Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace","display_weight":"700","display_transform":"uppercase","display_tracking":"-.022em","display_leading":"1.0","display_size":"clamp(2rem,5vw,3.6rem)","radius":"0","card_border":"1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)","card_shadow":"none","gap":"10px","measure":"64ch","font_href":"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@600;700&family=Libre+Franklin:wght@400;600&display=swap"},"acceptance_contract":"Legible at a glance and dense on purpose: a reader scanning for what changed must be able to do it without opening anything. The accent is a section flag and never decoration, and the dateline is never dropped -- a wire without a time on it is a claim without a moment.","cannot_infer":"a newsroom look is not a newsroom; nothing here was edited, verified or filed by anybody, and the urgency the typography carries is the design's and not the material's","status":"published"}
{"template":"ghost-dope","family":"dope","reference_source":"Ghost","reference_name":"Dope","reference_url":"https://ghost.org/themes/dope/","reference_categories":"creator,magazine,bold","renderer_mix":"vertical,stage,board,community","density":"loud","hero_mode":"oversized-title","navigation_mode":"inline","media_mode":"full-bleed","typography_mode":"display-grotesque","card_mode":"soft-panel","chrome_mode":"dark","territory_affinity":"live","semantic_roles":{"lede":"hook","meta":"who and when","accent":"the one loud thing","muted":"supporting"},"layout_tokens":{"ground":"#0f0d12","ink":"#f1ece4","display":"#ffffff","accent":"#ff5c00","muted":"#8f8798","rule":"rgba(255,255,255,.14)","panel":"#1a161f","face_display":"'Bricolage Grotesque','Archivo Black',sans-serif","face_body":"'Work Sans',system-ui,sans-serif","face_mono":"'DM Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace","display_weight":"800","display_transform":"none","display_tracking":"-.035em","display_leading":".95","display_size":"clamp(2.6rem,7vw,5.4rem)","radius":"14px","card_border":"1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)","card_shadow":"none","gap":"18px","measure":"56ch","font_href":"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap"},"acceptance_contract":"One loud thing per screen. The accent carries the whole voice, so anything else competing with it is a mistake; the ground stays dark and flat rather than gradient, and the picture is allowed to be the page.","cannot_infer":"a confident design is not a confident claim; loudness is a typographic choice this estate made and says nothing about how sure anybody is of what is written","status":"published"}
{"template":"ghost-bokeh","family":"bokeh","reference_source":"Ghost","reference_name":"Bokeh","reference_url":"https://ghost.org/themes/bokeh/","reference_categories":"photography,portfolio,visual","renderer_mix":"board,spatial,vertical","density":"airy","hero_mode":"quiet-title","navigation_mode":"minimal","media_mode":"gallery","typography_mode":"optical-serif","card_mode":"borderless","chrome_mode":"recessive","territory_affinity":"live,life","semantic_roles":{"lede":"caption to the whole set","meta":"where and when","accent":"almost never used","muted":"credit"},"layout_tokens":{"ground":"#fbfbf9","ink":"#1c1c1a","display":"#111110","accent":"#8a7f6e","muted":"#8d8880","rule":"rgba(0,0,0,.08)","panel":"#ffffff","face_display":"'Fraunces',Georgia,serif","face_body":"'Karla',system-ui,sans-serif","face_mono":"'DM Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace","display_weight":"400","display_transform":"none","display_tracking":"-.012em","display_leading":"1.04","display_size":"clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.6rem)","radius":"2px","card_border":"none","card_shadow":"none","gap":"24px","measure":"58ch","font_href":"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500&family=Karla:wght@400;500&display=swap"},"acceptance_contract":"The picture is the content and the chrome gets out of its way. Nothing crops a subject out of frame to make a grid tidy, captions sit under rather than over, and an item with no picture is a line of text rather than a grey rectangle pretending to be one.","cannot_infer":"a picture shown here is not a picture held here; the address, the digest and the moment of reading are what this estate keeps, and displaying something is not a licence to redistribute it","status":"published"}
{"template":"ghost-broadsheet","family":"broadsheet","reference_source":"Ghost","reference_name":"Broadsheet","reference_url":"https://ghost.org/themes/","reference_categories":"newspaper,longform,editorial","renderer_mix":"board,search,inspector,thread","density":"tight","hero_mode":"masthead","navigation_mode":"rail","media_mode":"inline-cut","typography_mode":"high-contrast-serif","card_mode":"column-rule","chrome_mode":"ruled","territory_affinity":"work,live","semantic_roles":{"lede":"standfirst","meta":"dateline and desk","accent":"rule and drop","muted":"attribution"},"layout_tokens":{"ground":"#f7f4ec","ink":"#16150f","display":"#000000","accent":"#7a1f14","muted":"#5d594c","rule":"rgba(0,0,0,.34)","panel":"#fffdf7","face_display":"'Bodoni Moda',Didot,Georgia,serif","face_body":"'Newsreader',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif","face_mono":"'DM Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace","display_weight":"700","display_transform":"none","display_tracking":"-.018em","display_leading":"1.0","display_size":"clamp(2.4rem,6.4vw,4.8rem)","radius":"0","card_border":"none","card_shadow":"none","gap":"0px","measure":"38ch","font_href":"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bodoni+Moda:opsz,wght@6..96,700;6..96,800&family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,600&display=swap"},"acceptance_contract":"Rules do the separating, not boxes. Columns hold a narrow measure so the eye can run them, the masthead is set once and not repeated, and every item keeps its dateline because a broadsheet without one is a poster.","cannot_infer":"a newspaper's authority is not conferred by a newspaper's typography; nothing set here was reported, sourced or corrected by this estate","status":"published"}
{"template":"ghost-source","family":"source","reference_source":"Ghost","reference_name":"Source","reference_url":"https://ghost.org/themes/source/","reference_categories":"publication,homepage,general","renderer_mix":"vertical,board,community,market,search","density":"regular","hero_mode":"sectioned","navigation_mode":"header","media_mode":"mixed","typography_mode":"modern-sans-serif-pair","card_mode":"soft-card","chrome_mode":"light","territory_affinity":"live,shop,work,life","semantic_roles":{"lede":"description","meta":"date and author","accent":"one action","muted":"secondary"},"layout_tokens":{"ground":"#ffffff","ink":"#15171a","display":"#0c0e11","accent":"#1b4dd6","muted":"#626d79","rule":"rgba(0,0,0,.1)","panel":"#ffffff","face_display":"'Instrument Sans',system-ui,sans-serif","face_body":"'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif","face_mono":"'DM Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace","display_weight":"600","display_transform":"none","display_tracking":"-.028em","display_leading":"1.06","display_size":"clamp(2.2rem,5.4vw,4rem)","radius":"10px","card_border":"1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.09)","card_shadow":"0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.05)","gap":"20px","measure":"62ch","font_href":"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Sans:wght@500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600&display=swap"},"acceptance_contract":"Sections are the structure and each one says what it holds before it holds it. One action per card, the accent used on that action and nowhere else, and a section with nothing in it is removed rather than shown empty.","cannot_infer":"a publication homepage is not an institution; the sections say what this address chose to show, never what it is entitled to act on","status":"published"}
